generate_practice_test returns a dict {multiple_choice:[...], short_answer:[...]}
(study_tools.py:155-178) and assignment_team stores it under kind='practice_test' as
json.dumps(parsed) (assignment_team.py:274-275). Every reader assumes a flat list: main.py:680-685
json.loads a practice_test back into a dict; routes_library.py:14-18 does the same;
routes_study_tools.py:184-185 sets `parsed_content = []` for non-list content before grading;
web/src/components/LibraryView.jsx:444-447 (and 431-434) pass `Array.isArray(content) ? content : []`.
Nothing anywhere flattens multiple_choice.

